{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04411","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 三十七 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 三十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝入云中郡，北望单于台。\n胡秦何密迩，沙朔气雄哉。\n藉藉天骄子，猖狂已复来。\n塞垣无名将，亭堠空崔嵬。\n咄嗟吾何叹，边人涂草莱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}